## The loop in one screen

1. **Before coding** — the phase is approved and ready ([01]({{ref_01}})).
2. **Per task** — read & ground → implement only the task's files → run its check → tick and re-read the plan ([02]({{ref_02}})).
3. **Phase end** — full suite, visual check (UI), self bug-hunt, evidence; out-of-scope fixes go back to the gate ([03]({{ref_03}})).
4. **Simplicity pass** on changed code only ([04]({{ref_04}})).
5. **Handoff** with phase ID, revisions, files, evidence ([05]({{ref_05}})).

