## Hard rules

1. Approved scope only; never start before {{gates}} are approved.
2. One phase at a time; dependencies `PASSED` first.
3. No bulk coding across tasks; re-read the plan before every task.
4. A mapped component/contract that does not fit is a planning blocker, not a local workaround.
5. `NOT_RUN`, `BLOCKED`, `UNVERIFIED` are never `PASS`.
6. Behavior/API/architecture/dependency changes go back to the gate.
7. Never fabricate data, services or fallbacks.

